    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I want to make sure we don't leave any room for their arguments to sound valid. Do you think it's fair to say that their stance on 'security' is basically just a bad-faith argument to prevent competition, or should I present it as a legitimate concern even if it's just a pretext?",
